# Celestial Reunion with its cost paid (type Elf, the two Elvish Mystics of the hand beheld) still puts a found card that is not
# the chosen type into the hand: the Birds of Paradise (a Bird) is revealed and goes to the hand, not the battlefield. X = 1:
# the Tarmogoyf (mana value 2) is past X and is not offered (the refusal is made with the Birds still in the library, so it
# is the mana value that refuses it).

